Windows: all 8 rustkit-engine media_host_tests need a media backend: the engine's side of
the MediaHost runs against a scripted FakeHost, but the metadata is still read through
AVFoundation (MEDIA-AVF step 2 probe), which exists on macOS only, so here no metadata is read (a
video's videoWidth stays 0, the test wants the fixture's 64). Ignored on Windows with that reason, as 661 ignores the
media fetch and load tests (the Windows media backend row).

Remove when Windows has a media backend.

